            For a floor that gets real traffic, <strong class="text-white">Bona Traffic HD</strong> is the most durable finish you can buy and worth its price. For a homeowner refinishing a room themselves, <strong class="text-white">Varathane Ultimate Floor Finish</strong> is the practical pick, and <strong class="text-white">General Finishes High Performance</strong> is what to use on stairs, cabinets and furniture where the finish quality is on show.
